  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Underwater_Village/MP_UnderwaterVillage_header.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"754\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">海洋過去有些寂寥，現在將充滿全新結構、村落型建築，甚至還有地牢！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所有結構均完美兼容原版遊戲，因此您應能順利將它們加入您的世界。目前新增超過十種新結構，未來還會有更多更新！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>準備好與朋友在頂級主機上一起遊玩了嗎？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Underwater_Village/MP_UnderwaterVillage_promo.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"293\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我推薦使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a> 與朋友一起玩，因為他們提供高品質且無延遲的伺服器。您可以無誤安裝任何 CurseForge 整合包或自訂模組。此外，他們的客服團隊全天候 24/7 待命，隨時協助解決問題。使用我的代碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>即可在購買時享受 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Underwater_Village/MP_UnderwaterVillage_description.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"193\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">盡情體驗全新的村落與海洋結構吧！現在的海底將變得更加美麗迷人且充滿樂趣，同時始終保持與原版遊戲的完美兼容。當然，這些結構內會有生物棲息，也會藏有各種寶藏與挑戰目標。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xe-FhsvCzr0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Underwater_Village/MP_UnderwaterVillage_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"193\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/519/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/520/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/521/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/522/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/523/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/524/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/525/2025-03-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Underwater_Village/MP_UnderwaterVillage_discord.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></strong></a></p>",
